           <p>The inscription was first notified by Swapan Kumar Biswas (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:Biswas2007_01"/></bibl>). Then Shariful Islam (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:SharifulIslam2010_01"/></bibl>)  attempted at its decipherment and edition. Properly edited by Ryosuke Furui (<bibl rend="omitname"><ptr target="bib:Furui2019_02"/></bibl>). Now reading checked against photographs taken by Adeline Levivier in November 2019 and revised on feedback from Shin’ichiro Hori. </p>
